# DUNE EXPRESS: a thing thrown past a guard's eyes puts him on alert (no
# shot, it's not an outlaw) and on his turn he goes to look where it fell.
game dune
wait 5
cheat mission 1
cheat law 0 32 6 0 0
cheat law 1 55 6 1 0
cheat pos 19 6
cheat face 1
wait 2
hold DOWN
press B
release DOWN
wait 2
expect carry == 2
press B
wait 40
expect law0_state == 2
expect law0_stun == 0
expect law0_armed == 1
expect alive == 1
expect phase == 1
wait 600
wait 100
expect law0_x < 500
